  "description": "Noted by Gsell (AAA, whence BAtlas), modern Akbou des Beni Ch\u00e9nacha was the site of a large establishment of the Roman period, probably a villa. The location was approximately 2 kilometers to the southwest of colonial Camp-du-Mar\u00e9chal (now Tadma\u00eft in Algeria's Tizi Ouzou province.",
